# imgbb upload key — get one free at https://api.imgbb.com/
# Required for the X link preview to show the generated badge.
# Without it the app still works: the tweet goes out caption-only and the
# badge is downloaded to disk instead.
#
# NOTE: VITE_ vars are inlined into the client bundle and are therefore public.
# This is an upload-only key, so the risk is quota abuse, not data loss.
VITE_IMGBB_KEY=
